# Queue live files

App DB in `database/production-design-queue-manager/`. Settings + I/O in app folder. SharedInbox stays warehouse-shared.

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `database/production-design-queue-manager/Configuration Workbook.xlsx` | Pocket / Override Print Size |
| `Production Design Queue Manager/config/queue_app_settings.json` | Design folders + last paths |
| `database/shared/custom_label/Custom_Label_Database.csv` | Print sizes (Width/Height mm) |
| `Production Design Queue Manager/{Input,Output,Logs,Missing Size Reference}` | Run I/O |
| `runtime/SharedInbox/DTF Des/` | Auto Missing Logo input |
